      "ZF": "R == 0",
      "SF": "bit31(R)",
      "PF": "even parity of low byte(R)",
      "AF": "((Q4 xor 12 xor R) & 0x10) != 0",
      "OF": "((~(Q4 xor 12) & (Q4 xor R)) & 0x80000000) != 0"
    },
    "accepted_caller_prefix": "The accepted ENTRY packet records a caller zero edge reaching BFBA09 with EAX=ESI=0 and ESP=T under that earlier local path and its stack qualification. Only the entry E8 preserves those values into C05B68 before that opaque callee executes. No zero value, prior stack slot, flags, segment attribute or other state is propagated through the first or any later opaque return.",
